@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@ CustomUI:
             title : Native VIP UI
             recommend : no
             author : DevSeara
-            desc : Adds the native server-backed VIP window with membership cards, quests, tickets, benefits, purchase confirmation and timer updates. Requires the matching VIP server implementation. Installs its supplied VIP artwork beside the patched client.
+            desc : Adds a dedicated VIP crown button after Bestiary in the ROGlobalZeroMenu main icon menu, plus the native server-backed VIP window with membership cards, quests, tickets, benefits, purchase confirmation and timer updates. Keeps the Settings/roulette button independent. Requires the matching VIP server implementation. Installs its supplied VIP artwork beside the patched client.
 
         - NoticeMarquee:
             title : Original Announcements with Item Icons
@@ -149,7 +149,7 @@ CustomUI:
             title : RO Global Zero Renewal Menu
             recommend : no
             author : Louis T Steinhil
-            desc : Uses the shared RO Global Zero theme state to select stock UIMenuIconWnd behavior for Classic UI or the uirenewal/menuicon panel for New UI. Twenty-five native commands compact into five columns; Auto Hunt, Item Collection, AutoSupport, and optional Bestiary then fill the remaining native-grid slots automatically before creating another row. These real native UIButton children use 45x41 New or 32x34 Classic normal, hover, and pressed images, while the native MENU toggle retains the final reserved slot. Row sizing counts native commands, visible custom buttons, and MENU so close, hidden warp/teleport, and reopen retain stable geometry. Complete 1-6-row New backgrounds are selected from the live count. Classic draws no custom full-panel background. Available Cash Shop, Gold PC Cafe, Roulette, and RO DEX notification launchers stack below the minimap without being force-created. QJS-only.
+            desc : Uses the shared RO Global Zero theme state to select stock UIMenuIconWnd behavior for Classic UI or the uirenewal/menuicon panel for New UI. Twenty-five native commands compact into five columns; Auto Hunt, Item Collection, AutoSupport, and optional Bestiary, VIP and Battle Pass then fill the remaining native-grid slots automatically before creating another row. These real native UIButton children use 45x41 New or 32x34 Classic normal, hover, and pressed images, while the native MENU toggle retains the final reserved slot. Row sizing counts native commands, visible custom buttons, and MENU so close, hidden warp/teleport, and reopen retain stable geometry. Complete 1-7-row New backgrounds are selected from the live count. Classic draws no custom full-panel background. Available Cash Shop, Gold PC Cafe, Roulette, and RO DEX notification launchers stack below the minimap without being force-created. QJS-only.
 
         - AllowShortcutsInWine:
             title : Allow shortcuts in WINE [Experimental]
